'''Sacred Suffering''' is a debuff that is applied by [[Oshabi, Avatar of the Grove]] while standing on the ground effect generated by Vine Barrier.

This debuff stacks to 10, persists for a duration, and reduces Physical Damage Reduction and Maximum Resistances. 


